[en.IDEA_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_4]
Faded Friendship

[en.IDEA_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_4_desc]
Princess Twilight Sparkle and her friends vanished from every pony's sight. There is no public prison, no credible record, and no word proving whether they live or die. The usurpers sit upon thrones of blood and tears, calling silence “victory” and forging secrets into chains. In the name of the “victory of the new order”, they §Rlock truth and hope away together in a place no pony knows.§!

[en.IDEA_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_4_TOOLTIP]
§RNo Princess of Friendship answers us anymore...§!

[zh.IDEA_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_4]
友谊的消逝

[zh.IDEA_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_4_desc]
暮光闪闪公主和她的朋友们从所有小马眼前消失了。没有公开的牢房，没有可信的记录，也没有任何能够证明她们生死的消息。窃国者们坐在血与泪铸就的王座上，将沉默称作“胜利”，将秘密铸成锁链，以“新秩序的胜利”为名，§R把真相与希望一同锁在无马知晓的地方。§!

[zh.IDEA_C08_FADED_FRIENDSHIP_4_TOOLTIP]
§R再也没有友谊公主回应我们了……§!
